<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cooper Industries cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cooper Industries cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it cut the rating on Cooper Industries Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3/8 to 40-7/8.</p>
</text>
